From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tangenx <me@tangenx.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 16:26:06 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 039/128] feat: icon rows for tele settings sections

The section links now use the same cell as the main settings list, with
a coloured circle icon and a subtitle per section, and share one section
with the tele version row instead of sitting behind a separate header.

Confidence: high
Scope-risk: narrow
---
 .../tele/ui/settings/TeleSettingsActivity.kt  | 37 ++++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 27 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/ui/settings/TeleSettingsActivity.kt b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/ui/settings/TeleSettingsActivity.kt
index 29f829f9b..0bde80852 100644
--- a/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/ui/settings/TeleSettingsActivity.kt
+++ b/TMessagesProj/src/main/java/tele/ui/settings/TeleSettingsActivity.kt
